- [Microsoft Dynamics CRM](https://www.workato.com/integrations/microsoft_dynamics_crm): Integrate Dynamics CRM with back-office systems, marketing tools, and customer service platforms using Workato.
- [Pipedrive](https://www.workato.com/integrations/pipedrive): Automate deal stage movements, contact syncs, and activity logging between Pipedrive and connected business systems.
- [Zoho CRM](https://www.workato.com/integrations/zohocrm): Connect Zoho CRM to marketing automation, helpdesk, and ERP — automate lead management and customer data workflows.
- [SugarCRM](https://www.workato.com/integrations/sugarcrm): Sync SugarCRM with marketing, support, and operational systems — automate contact management and pipeline workflows.
- [Copper](https://www.workato.com/integrations/copper): Automate Google Workspace-native CRM workflows — sync Copper contacts, deals, and activities with business systems.
